OL,3,AFire engulfs Bermondsey waste centre
OL,4,
OL,5,FAbout 100 firefighters are tackling a
OL,6,Fmassive blaze at a waste facility in
OL,7,Fsouth-east London.
OL,9,FFifteen fire engines were called to
OL,10,FLandmann Way in Bermondsey shortly
OL,11,Fbefore 20:00 BST after about 50 tonnes
OL,12,Fof household waste caught fire.
OL,14,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) warned that a
OL,15,Flarge amount of smoke was being
OL,16,Fproduced by the blaze and advised local
OL,17,Fresidents to keep their doors and
OL,18,Fwindows closed.
OL,20,FLFB said the cause of the fire was not
OL,21,Fyet known, but firefighters tackled a
OL,22,Fblaze at the same facility in June.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
